<title>UK: Argentina sets 1.0 billion mark Feb 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 1.0 billion mark Feb 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CS First Boston and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     8.50 PCT  MATURITY    23.FEB.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE   S23.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.875     REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	+295 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  GOV LAW    GERMAN    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.125     SELL CONC  1.25	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JANUARY 2005 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
